worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_catalog_parameters.js"
  ceiling 170
  rationale "Binds request operands and derives expected output for the portable catalog. The Rust catalog implements the same operations for native runs, and hosted tests compare generated programs with the operands and actual output. Issue #1580 adds three lines to exclude artifact counts before a canonical program-kind surface from algorithm operands; rust/src/coding/catalog_parameters.rs implements the same rule. Unknown operands and explicit one/five operands retain separate regression controls."
